WEBVTT

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.400
The pixel dust crossed the stylus bridge!

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.500
It is turning every gentle curve into rigid squares!

00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:26.730
True color never breaks into boxes.

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:31.130
Watch the continuous spectrum mend every jagged edge!
